  "description": {
   "en": "A fake engagement between a love novice and an all-perfect guy!\nRachiel, a member of the Jaharry family, plans a political marriage with Fahad, the second son of the Aurecia family, who has good looks, good family and financial power, for the sake of her impoverished family.\nWhen he asks her to marry him, she unexpectedly says yes!\nRachiel tries to show off her flirtatious side in front of everyone, but Fahad, who is not good at romance, is always pushed around by Rachiel...?"
  },
